    "MACOS" : {

    },
    "macOS %lld+" : {

    },
    "macOS guest iCloud identity is automatic for VMs created from a supported macOS restore image; upgrading an older VM does not add that identity. Metal improvements are supplied automatically by the supported host, guest, and Mac hardware model. Neither requires an additional RiftVM entitlement." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "使用受支持的 macOS 恢复映像创建的虚拟机会自动获得 macOS 客体 iCloud 身份；升级旧虚拟机不会添加该身份。Metal 改进由受支持的主机、客体系统和 Mac 硬件型号自动提供。两者都不需要额外的 RiftVM 权限。"
          }
        }
      }
