            "value" : "快照存储在虚拟机包内，并在可用时使用 APFS 写时拷贝。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Snapshots form a history tree. Restore an earlier snapshot and create a new one to start another branch." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "快照构成一棵历史树。恢复到较早的快照并创建新快照，即可开启另一个分支。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Snapshots use macOS 27 ASIF overlay layers and are stored inside the machine bundle." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "快照使用 macOS 27 的 ASIF 叠加层，并存储在虚拟机包内。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
