            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这些值来自当前运行的 RiftVM 进程中的 macOS 27 权限。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This snapshot chain is deep. Audit it before adding more snapshots, keep an exported backup, and remove unneeded leaf branches. RiftVM does not compact layered ASIF disks in place." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此快照链层数较深。继续添加快照前请先审计完整性、保留导出备份，并删除不再需要的叶子分支。RiftVM 目前不能原地压缩分层 ASIF 磁盘。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
